{"id":"c462e4cd1ccada77","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md","title":"Itô's Lemma","display":"df-ito-lemma — Itô's Lemma","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ito-lemma","aliases":["58-df-ito-lemma","Itô's Lemma"],"display":"df-ito-lemma — Itô's Lemma","depends_on":["[[58-df-ito-integral]]","[[58-df-semimartingale]]","[[58-df-brownian-motion]]","[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ito-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ito-lemma</span><span>Itô's Lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ito-lemma — Itô's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44af585e6fa080e5\" href=\"?note=44af585e6fa080e5\" title=\"58-df-ito-integral\">58-df-ito-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f0355544d1bb59cc\" href=\"?note=f0355544d1bb59cc\" title=\"58-df-semimartingale\">58-df-semimartingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"58-df-brownian-motion\">58-df-brownian-motion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6ad876d2c15e685f\" href=\"?note=6ad876d2c15e685f\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-derivative.md\">../batch15/58-df-derivative.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mu,\\sigma\">\\(X,\\mu,\\sigma\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\">\\(T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\)</span> 的编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat H=\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S(H,\\Omega)\">\\(\\widehat H=\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S(H,\\Omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_s(w)=X(s)(w)\">\\(X_s(w)=X(s)(w)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueIntegral}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueIntegral}_S\\)</span> 的三元接口仍作用于确定性函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:[0,t]\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(h:[0,t]\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>，不是作用于随机过程。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;=D(f)\">\\(f&#39;=D(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;&#39;=D(D(f))\">\\(f&#39;&#39;=D(D(f))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_1,H_2,H_3\">\\(H_1,H_2,H_3\\)</span> 分别为显式函数图\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,f&#39;(X_s(w))\\mu_s(w)\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,f&#39;(X_s(w))\\mu_s(w)\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,f&#39;(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,f&#39;(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,f&#39;&#39;(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)^2\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,f&#39;&#39;(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)^2\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semimartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Semimartingale}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f0355544d1bb59cc\" href=\"?note=f0355544d1bb59cc\" title=\"58-df-semimartingale\">58-df-semimartingale</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}\">\\(\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"58-df-brownian-motion\">58-df-brownian-motion</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}\">\\(\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44af585e6fa080e5\" href=\"?note=44af585e6fa080e5\" title=\"58-df-ito-integral\">58-df-ito-integral</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ItoFormula}\">\\(\\mathrm{ItoFormula}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ItoProcess}\">\\(\\mathrm{ItoProcess}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueIntegral}_S(J,h,t)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(J,h,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LebesgueIntegral}_S(J,h,t)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(J,h,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S(X,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists I,J\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,\\widehat\\sigma,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(J,\\widehat\\mu,t,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;X_t(w)=X_0(w)+J(w)+I(w)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S(X,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists I,J\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,\\widehat\\sigma,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(J,\\widehat\\mu,t,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;X_t(w)=X_0(w)+J(w)+I(w)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\\land t\\in T\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists I,J,K\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H_2,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(J,H_1,t,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(K,H_3,t,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{23mm}\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\nf(X_t(w))=f(X_0(w))+J(w)+I(w)+\\tfrac12K(w)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\\land t\\in T\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists I,J,K\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H_2,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(J,H_1,t,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(K,H_3,t,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{23mm}\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\nf(X_t(w))=f(X_0(w))+J(w)+I(w)+\\tfrac12K(w)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原逐点平衡关系予以保留。这里定义的是满足该平衡关系的数据，不把它改成任意局部积分意义的过程，也不在此宣称无条件的 Itô 定理。</li>\n<li>三元 <code>LebesgueIntegral_S</code> 的实值确定性积分对象未变；随机时间积分通过逐路径的实值积分展开，不能直接将过程传给确定性三元接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Protter, Stochastic Integration and Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ito-integral","status":"resolved","id":"44af585e6fa080e5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ito-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-semimartingale","status":"resolved","id":"f0355544d1bb59cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-semimartingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-brownian-motion","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-brownian-motion]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"6ad876d2c15e685f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-semimartingale","status":"resolved","id":"f0355544d1bb59cc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Semimartingale}$ 取 [[58-df-semimartingale]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}$、$\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}$ 取 [[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-brownian-motion","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}$ 取 [[58-df-brownian-motion]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ito-integral","status":"resolved","id":"44af585e6fa080e5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}$ 取 [[58-df-ito-integral]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mu,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat H=\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S(H,\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"X_s(w)=X(s)(w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueIntegral}_S","display":false},{"tex":"h:[0,t]\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f'=D(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f''=D(D(f))","display":false},{"tex":"H_1,H_2,H_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,f'(X_s(w))\\mu_s(w)\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,f'(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,f''(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)^2\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semimartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ItoFormula}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ItoProcess}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueIntegral}_S(J,h,t)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(J,h,t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Semimartingale}_S(X,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists I,J\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,\\widehat\\sigma,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(J,\\widehat\\mu,t,\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;X_t(w)=X_0(w)+J(w)+I(w)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\\land t\\in T\\\\\n&\\land\\exists I,J,K\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H_2,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(J,H_1,t,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(K,H_3,t,\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\hspace{23mm}\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\nf(X_t(w))=f(X_0(w))+J(w)+I(w)+\\tfrac12K(w)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3809,"backlinks":[{"id":"211a4101b02c699d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S$ and $\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S$ are the predicates from [[../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-712","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md|58-df-ito-lemma]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["44af585e6fa080e5","f0355544d1bb59cc","948f8f3178040b74","b91a21e76d0947e0","6ad876d2c15e685f"]}